# Quizzic — Fullstack Setup Guide

## Stack

| Layer    | Technology                                                  |
| -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |
| Frontend | React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + SCSS                         |
| Backend  | Node.js + Express 5 + TypeScript + Prisma 7                 |
| Database | PostgreSQL (hosted on [Prisma Postgres](https://prisma.io)) |
| Runner   | `concurrently` (both servers from one command)              |

---

## Prerequisites

- **Node.js 20+** — check with `node -v`
- **npm 9+** — check with `npm -v`
- A **PostgreSQL connection string** (local or [Prisma Postgres](https://console.prisma.io))

---

## 1 — Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/<your-repo>.git
cd <your-repo>
```

---

## 2 — Install dependencies

Install each project separately (the frontend's `postinstall` script must run from its own directory):

```bash
# Root — installs concurrently
npm install

# Backend
cd backend && npm install && cd ..

# Frontend
cd frontend && npm install && cd ..
```

---

## 3 — Configure the backend environment

Enter backend directory and create a database with Prisma:

```bash
cd backend && npx create-db
```

Claim a database in the cloud and copy your connection string. Then create a `.env` file inside the `backend/` folder:

```bash
# backend/.env
DATABASE_URL="enter your connection string here"
PORT=3000
```

---

## 4 — Run database migrations

```bash
npx prisma migrate deploy
```

Then generate the Prisma client:

```bash
npx prisma generate
```

---

## 5 — Run frontend and backend concurrently

From the **project root**:

```bash
cd .. && npm run dev
```

---

## Project structure

```
quizzic/
├── backend/
│   ├── prisma/
│   │   ├── schema.prisma       # DB models: Quiz, Question, CheckboxOption
│   │   └── migrations/         # SQL migration history
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── controllers/        # Route handlers
│   │   ├── repository/         # Prisma queries
│   │   ├── routes/             # Express routers
│   │   ├── middlewares/        # Error handler
│   │   └── index.ts            # Server entry point
│   ├── .env                    # DATABASE_URL (not committed)
│   └── package.json
│
├── frontend/
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── api/                # Fetch wrapper + quiz API methods
│   │   ├── components/         # Reusable UI components
│   │   ├── pages/              # Route-level pages
│   │   └── types/              # Global TypeScript types
│   └── package.json
│
└── package.json                # Root workspace + concurrently scripts
```

---

## API reference

| Method   | Path           | Description                                 |
| -------- | -------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| `GET`    | `/quizzes`     | List all quizzes (id, title, questionCount) |
| `POST`   | `/quizzes`     | Create a new quiz                           |
| `GET`    | `/quizzes/:id` | Get full quiz with all questions            |
| `DELETE` | `/quizzes/:id` | Delete a quiz                               |
